<p>Hi <%= @reservation.contact_name.presence || @reservation.user&.name %>,</p>

<p>Your reservation at <strong>Restaurant Reservation</strong> has been cancelled. Details below:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Date:</strong> <%= @reservation.formatted_date %></li>
  <li><strong>Time:</strong> <%= @reservation.formatted_time %></li>
  <li><strong>Party size:</strong> <%= @reservation.num_people %></li>

  <li><strong>Cancelled at:</strong> <%= (@reservation.cancelled_at || Time.zone.now).strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %></li>
</ul>

<p>If you believe this was a mistake, please contact us or create a new reservation.</p>

<p>— Restaurant Reservation</p>
